[[2,3,16,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The supply for the fan \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               arrives\ndirectly from the battery from the line for the VENT maxifuse of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B6</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              :\nthe fan therefore works when it receives an earth command.</p><p>The relays \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , specific\nto the cooling system, receive a supply at their coils from the\nline controlled by the ignition (15/54) protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B25</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>They are energized by an earth signal coming\nfrom the engine control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>If the engine coolant reaches the first\ntemperature stage, or the 4 stage pressure switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin\n3) signals to the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 44) that the first\npressure stage has been reached, then the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends\nan earth signal (from pin 26) to the 1st speed fan relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which\nenergizes the coil. The relay then sends an earth signal which,\nvia the additional resistor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>O10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , operates the fan \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which\nrotates at the first (slow) speed.</p><p>If the engine coolant reaches a higher temperature\nor the 4-stage pressure switch K10 (pin 6) signals to the control\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 43) that a higher pressure stage has been reached,\nthe control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends (from pin 25) an earth signal\nto the 2nd speed fan relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which energizes the coil.\nThe relay then sends an earth signal directly to the fan \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which\nrotates at the maximum speed.</p>"]]